#showas:长老獾
Can your Spire Empire survive two Brutal but low level AIs? Simply finding your way around a Hidden Galaxy Cubular map may become a challenge.

To complicate matters, the AIs are joined by several powerful Neinzul factions, led by high intensity Elderlings.

Showdown Devices make for a potential alternate win condition, but be wary of the Dire CPAs and Brutal Guardians.
